}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs35 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs35{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs32\cf2 Let\'92s break down the example provided:\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs35 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs35{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs32\cf2 1. Total Hours in a Week: \par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s4\li2250\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1710 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs32 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs32{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs32\cf2    - 7  days\'d7 24  hours = 168  hours\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs35 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs35{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs32\cf2 2. Hours Unavailable Each Week: \par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s4\li2250\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1710 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs32 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs32{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs32\cf2    - 2  hours (for planned maintenance)\par 
