}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs53 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs53{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs48\cf2 Systems are in place, your team is efficient, and everything seems to be going well. \par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs53 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs53{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs48\cf2 Traffic is increasing, and your sales team is pleased.\par 
