}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s4\li2250\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1710 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs48 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs48{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs48\cf2 But then it happens again. And again. \par 
