}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s1\li540\fi-540\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0\qc {\b\shad\f1\fs56\cf1 What to Do When Availability Begins to Slip\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs40 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 If availability starts to decline, it\'92s essential to take proactive steps to improve it and maintain customer satisfaction.  Here are some key actions you can take:\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs40 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 - }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 Measure and Track Current Availability}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 : Understanding your current availability is the first step. Regularly monitor and report your availability percentage to identify trends.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs40 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 - }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 Automate Manual Processes: }{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 Streamlining processes can reduce human error and improve efficiency.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs40 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 - }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 Automate Deployment Processes: }{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 This helps ensure consistency and speed in your updates.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs40 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 - }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 Maintain Configuration Management: }{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 Keep track of all configurations in a management system for better oversight.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs40 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 - }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 Enable Quick Changes with Rollback Capabilities: }{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 This allows for rapid experimentation without significant risk.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs40 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 - Aim for Continuous Improvement: }{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 Regularly assess and enhance your applications and systems.\par 
