}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs37 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs37{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\cf2    - Calculate your availability percentage over time to measure performance.\par 
