}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs37 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs37{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\cf2    - Implement service tiers to categorize services based on their criticality to business operations.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs37 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs37{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\cf2    - This distinction helps prioritize resources effectively.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\dbch\af2\loch\f1\cf2 \par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\loch\af1\dbch\f10\fs37 \'a7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnfs37{\pntxtb \'a7}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\cf2 3. Create and Maintain a}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\cf2  Risk Matrix}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\cf2 :\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs37 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs37{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\cf2    - A risk matrix provides visibility into technical debt and associated risks within your application.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs37 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs37{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\cf2    - Regularly review risk management plans and implement mitigation strategies.\par 
