}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s1\li540\fi-540\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0\qc {\b\shad\f1\fs56\cf1 CI/CD\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs44 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 Continuous Integration (CI)}{\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 :\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs44 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 What it is}{\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 : CI involves frequently integrating code changes into a shared repository. Developers commit their code to this central repository multiple times a day.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs44 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 Why it matters}{\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 : By doing this, teams catch integration issues early. It ensures that everyone\'92s work is combined and tested together, reducing the risk of conflicts and bugs during the later stages.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs44 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 Example}{\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 : Imagine you\'92re working on a team building a web application. Each developer writes their code and commits it to the central repository. The CI system automatically triggers a build process (compiling code, running tests, etc.) whenever a new commit is made. If any tests fail, the team is notified immediately, allowing them to fix issues promptly.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs40\cf2 \par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s1\li540\fi-540\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0\qc {\b\shad\f1\fs56\cf1 CI/CD\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s1\li540\fi-540\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li0\fi0\qc {\b\shad\f1\fs56\cf1 CI/CD\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs44 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 Continuous Deployment (CD)}{\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 :\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs44 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 What it is}{\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 : CD extends CI by automating the deployment process. It ensures that code changes are automatically deployed to production environments once they pass all tests.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs44 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 Why it matters}{\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 : CD reduces manual intervention, minimizes the time between writing code and deploying it, and increases the reliability of releases.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs44 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 Example}{\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 : Continuing with our web application scenario, after successful CI, the CD pipeline takes over. It automatically deploys the tested code to staging or production servers. Users get access to new features or bug fixes without waiting for a manual deployment process.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1170\fi-450\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li540\fi-540 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs44 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'95}}{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 The CI/CD Pipeline}{\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 :\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs44 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf9\pnfs44{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f9\fs40\cf2 The CI/CD pipeline is the set of automated steps that code goes through from development to production.\par 
