}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs40 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2    - Action: Implement monitoring tools like New }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 Relic}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2  or }{\b\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2 Datadog}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2  to track uptime.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs40 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2    - Example: Set up alerts for downtime and log incidents in a shared dashboard. After a week, you find out that the platform has been down for a total of 12 hours due to server overload during peak times.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs40 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2    - Result: Calculate availability as follows:\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs40 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2     Availability = ( Total Time - Downtime/Total Time) \'d7 100\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1710\fi-360\loch\af5\dbch\f2\fs34\lang1033\li1170\fi-450 {\pntext\pard\plain\dbch\af2\loch\f5\fs40 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnfs40{\pntxtb \'95}}{\dbch\af2\loch\f1\fs36\cf2      For a week (168 hours): \par 
